ah-sing-to-hold-sales-preview-for-m-oscar)\nciteturn294search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7.0 years ago; Crawled: 7.0 years ago; ## Mah Sing to hold sales preview for M Oscar\n\nImage Image\n\n## Mah Sing to hold sales preview for M Oscar\n\nPosted on  26 Sep 2019\n\nby Viktor Chong\n\nShare this article   \n\nArtist impression of M Oscar, located off Kuchai Lama.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR: Mah Sing Group Bhd (Mah Sing) will be holding the preview of the public sales for its new high-rise residential development, M Oscar throughout the weekend of Oct 5 and 6. \n\nMah Sing Group Bhd founder and group managing director Tan Sri Datuk Sri Leong Hoy Kum said, “M Oscar is one of our latest high-rise developments in Klang Valley and it is well-designed with features that meet the market needs. The project is located at a very prime area and is suitable for families who are looking to upgrade to better security and lifestyle. \n\n“The sales preview will give home buyers a clearer picture of what M Oscar could offer and we are confident that this will be the right development for home seekers who are looking for an ideal home around the neighbourhood.”\n\nHomebuyers who are keen about the project can seize this opportunity to grab the unit of their selection to enjoy early bird incentives. The impending sales preview will be held at the upcoming M Oscar Sales Gallery located at the lower ground floor of Seri Gembira Avenue, Taman Gembira. The M Oscar Sales Gallery will be open for public viewing starting Oct 2. \n\nM Oscar which sits on 4.63 acres of land located off Kuchai Lama, next to Happy Garden and Sri Petaling, will have an estimated gross development value of approximately RM500mil. The proposed 2-bedroom units would have an indicative built-up from 700 sq ft and indicative starting price from RM428,000.\n\n \n\nWant to contribute articles to StarProperty.my? Email: editor@starproperty.my--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nM Osca